Imveliso bhala: (Inkqubo X ['QQ:']), umgca-omtsha.
Imveliso bhala: (Inkqubo X ['QQ:QQ:']), umgca-omtsha.

Imveliso bhala: (Inkqubo YY), umgca-omtsha.
Imveliso bhala: (Inkqubo fumana: ['YY']), umgca-omtsha.
Imveliso bhala: (Inkqubo fumana: ['Y']), umgca-omtsha.

Imveliso bhala: (Inkqubo YY: ['QQ']), umgca-omtsha.
